[
  {
    "start": "00:00:00.000",
    "end": "00:00:02.110",
    "start_seconds": 0.0,
    "end_seconds": 2.11,
    "text": "Next day I get on the flight"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:02.110",
    "end": "00:00:02.120",
    "start_seconds": 2.11,
    "end_seconds": 2.12,
    "text": "Next day I get on the flight"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:02.120",
    "end": "00:00:05.270",
    "start_seconds": 2.12,
    "end_seconds": 5.27,
    "text": "Next day I get on the flight on my way back to Houston."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:05.270",
    "end": "00:00:05.280",
    "start_seconds": 5.27,
    "end_seconds": 5.28,
    "text": "on my way back to Houston."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:05.280",
    "end": "00:00:08.270",
    "start_seconds": 5.28,
    "end_seconds": 8.27,
    "text": "on my way back to Houston. And this when God shows up."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:08.270",
    "end": "00:00:08.280",
    "start_seconds": 8.27,
    "end_seconds": 8.28,
    "text": "And this when God shows up."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:08.280",
    "end": "00:00:13.350",
    "start_seconds": 8.28,
    "end_seconds": 13.35,
    "text": "And this when God shows up. I knew he was coming."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:13.360",
    "end": "00:00:16.310",
    "start_seconds": 13.36,
    "end_seconds": 16.31,
    "text": "That's why I was trying to hurry up and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:16.310",
    "end": "00:00:16.320",
    "start_seconds": 16.31,
    "end_seconds": 16.32,
    "text": "That's why I was trying to hurry up and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:16.320",
    "end": "00:00:19.230",
    "start_seconds": 16.32,
    "end_seconds": 19.23,
    "text": "That's why I was trying to hurry up and get the divorce."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:19.230",
    "end": "00:00:19.240",
    "start_seconds": 19.23,
    "end_seconds": 19.24,
    "text": "get the divorce."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:19.240",
    "end": "00:00:23.390",
    "start_seconds": 19.24,
    "end_seconds": 23.39,
    "text": "get the divorce. Because I knew he was going to show up."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:23.390",
    "end": "00:00:23.400",
    "start_seconds": 23.39,
    "end_seconds": 23.4,
    "text": "Because I knew he was going to show up."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:23.400",
    "end": "00:00:26.110",
    "start_seconds": 23.4,
    "end_seconds": 26.11,
    "text": "Because I knew he was going to show up. My cousin Reggie was my lawyer. He'd"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.110",
    "end": "00:00:26.120",
    "start_seconds": 26.11,
    "end_seconds": 26.12,
    "text": "My cousin Reggie was my lawyer. He'd"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.120",
    "end": "00:00:29.510",
    "start_seconds": 26.12,
    "end_seconds": 29.51,
    "text": "My cousin Reggie was my lawyer. He'd been married and divorced twice. I hired"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.510",
    "end": "00:00:29.520",
    "start_seconds": 29.51,
    "end_seconds": 29.52,
    "text": "been married and divorced twice. I hired"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.520",
    "end": "00:00:36.190",
    "start_seconds": 29.52,
    "end_seconds": 36.19,
    "text": "been married and divorced twice. I hired him because he know how to do it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:36.200",
    "end": "00:00:42.510",
    "start_seconds": 36.2,
    "end_seconds": 42.51,
    "text": "But he fumbling my paperwork."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:42.520",
    "end": "00:00:44.150",
    "start_seconds": 42.52,
    "end_seconds": 44.15,
    "text": "So I'm on the flight"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.150",
    "end": "00:00:44.160",
    "start_seconds": 44.15,
    "end_seconds": 44.16,
    "text": "So I'm on the flight"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.160",
    "end": "00:00:46.670",
    "start_seconds": 44.16,
    "end_seconds": 46.67,
    "text": "So I'm on the flight back to Houston."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.670",
    "end": "00:00:46.680",
    "start_seconds": 46.67,
    "end_seconds": 46.68,
    "text": "back to Houston."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.680",
    "end": "00:00:47.990",
    "start_seconds": 46.68,
    "end_seconds": 47.99,
    "text": "back to Houston. And I remember vividly this what God"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:47.990",
    "end": "00:00:48.000",
    "start_seconds": 47.99,
    "end_seconds": 48.0,
    "text": "And I remember vividly this what God"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:48.000",
    "end": "00:00:50.870",
    "start_seconds": 48.0,
    "end_seconds": 50.87,
    "text": "And I remember vividly this what God said. God said,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:50.870",
    "end": "00:00:50.880",
    "start_seconds": 50.87,
    "end_seconds": 50.88,
    "text": "said. God said,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:50.880",
    "end": "00:00:53.870",
    "start_seconds": 50.88,
    "end_seconds": 53.87,
    "text": "said. God said, \"My God, let me get this straight."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:53.870",
    "end": "00:00:53.880",
    "start_seconds": 53.87,
    "end_seconds": 53.88,
    "text": "\"My God, let me get this straight."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:53.880",
    "end": "00:00:55.470",
    "start_seconds": 53.88,
    "end_seconds": 55.47,
    "text": "\"My God, let me get this straight. Oh, y'all think he talk like, 'My"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:55.470",
    "end": "00:00:55.480",
    "start_seconds": 55.47,
    "end_seconds": 55.48,
    "text": "Oh, y'all think he talk like, 'My"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:55.480",
    "end": "00:00:58.390",
    "start_seconds": 55.48,
    "end_seconds": 58.39,
    "text": "Oh, y'all think he talk like, 'My child.' That's how y'all think?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.390",
    "end": "00:00:58.400",
    "start_seconds": 58.39,
    "end_seconds": 58.4,
    "text": "child.' That's how y'all think?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.400",
    "end": "00:01:02.670",
    "start_seconds": 58.4,
    "end_seconds": 62.67,
    "text": "child.' That's how y'all think? That's why you mishearing him."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.680",
    "end": "00:01:04.590",
    "start_seconds": 62.68,
    "end_seconds": 64.59,
    "text": "He says,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:04.590",
    "end": "00:01:04.600",
    "start_seconds": 64.59,
    "end_seconds": 64.6,
    "text": "He says,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:04.600",
    "end": "00:01:06.190",
    "start_seconds": 64.6,
    "end_seconds": 66.19,
    "text": "He says, \"My God, let me get this straight. So"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:06.190",
    "end": "00:01:06.200",
    "start_seconds": 66.19,
    "end_seconds": 66.2,
    "text": "\"My God, let me get this straight. So"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:06.200",
    "end": "00:01:09.470",
    "start_seconds": 66.2,
    "end_seconds": 69.47,
    "text": "\"My God, let me get this straight. So you getting ready to divorce this girl"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:09.470",
    "end": "00:01:09.480",
    "start_seconds": 69.47,
    "end_seconds": 69.48,
    "text": "you getting ready to divorce this girl"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:09.480",
    "end": "00:01:12.590",
    "start_seconds": 69.48,
    "end_seconds": 72.59,
    "text": "you getting ready to divorce this girl because she do a few things"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:12.590",
    "end": "00:01:12.600",
    "start_seconds": 72.59,
    "end_seconds": 72.6,
    "text": "because she do a few things"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:12.600",
    "end": "00:01:14.550",
    "start_seconds": 72.6,
    "end_seconds": 74.55,
    "text": "because she do a few things you don't like."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.550",
    "end": "00:01:14.560",
    "start_seconds": 74.55,
    "end_seconds": 74.56,
    "text": "you don't like."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.560",
    "end": "00:01:16.230",
    "start_seconds": 74.56,
    "end_seconds": 76.23,
    "text": "you don't like. Yet"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:16.230",
    "end": "00:01:16.240",
    "start_seconds": 76.23,
    "end_seconds": 76.24,
    "text": "Yet"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:16.240",
    "end": "00:01:19.910",
    "start_seconds": 76.24,
    "end_seconds": 79.91,
    "text": "Yet I have not divorced you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.920",
    "end": "00:01:25.910",
    "start_seconds": 79.92,
    "end_seconds": 85.91,
    "text": "And you do a plethora of things"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:25.920",
    "end": "00:01:28.070",
    "start_seconds": 85.92,
    "end_seconds": 88.07,
    "text": "I don't like."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:28.070",
    "end": "00:01:28.080",
    "start_seconds": 88.07,
    "end_seconds": 88.08,
    "text": "I don't like."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:28.080",
    "end": "00:01:31.550",
    "start_seconds": 88.08,
    "end_seconds": 91.55,
    "text": "I don't like. Not only have I not divorced you,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:31.550",
    "end": "00:01:31.560",
    "start_seconds": 91.55,
    "end_seconds": 91.56,
    "text": "Not only have I not divorced you,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:31.560",
    "end": "00:01:43.230",
    "start_seconds": 91.56,
    "end_seconds": 103.22999999999999,
    "text": "Not only have I not divorced you, I haven't even exposed you.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:43.240",
    "end": "00:01:45.470",
    "start_seconds": 103.24000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 105.47,
    "text": "The plane land."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:45.470",
    "end": "00:01:45.480",
    "start_seconds": 105.47,
    "end_seconds": 105.47999999999999,
    "text": "The plane land."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:45.480",
    "end": "00:01:48.030",
    "start_seconds": 105.47999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 108.03,
    "text": "The plane land. I jump in my truck."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:48.030",
    "end": "00:01:48.040",
    "start_seconds": 108.03,
    "end_seconds": 108.03999999999999,
    "text": "I jump in my truck."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:48.040",
    "end": "00:01:50.430",
    "start_seconds": 108.03999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 110.43,
    "text": "I jump in my truck. I drive straight to Erica apartment"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:50.430",
    "end": "00:01:50.440",
    "start_seconds": 110.43,
    "end_seconds": 110.44,
    "text": "I drive straight to Erica apartment"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:50.440",
    "end": "00:01:57.510",
    "start_seconds": 110.44,
    "end_seconds": 117.50999999999999,
    "text": "I drive straight to Erica apartment because it's her apartment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:57.520",
    "end": "00:01:59.830",
    "start_seconds": 117.52000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 119.83,
    "text": "And let me say this, stop feeling bad"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:59.830",
    "end": "00:01:59.840",
    "start_seconds": 119.83,
    "end_seconds": 119.84,
    "text": "And let me say this, stop feeling bad"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:59.840",
    "end": "00:02:01.070",
    "start_seconds": 119.84,
    "end_seconds": 121.07,
    "text": "And let me say this, stop feeling bad for women."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:01.070",
    "end": "00:02:01.080",
    "start_seconds": 121.07,
    "end_seconds": 121.08,
    "text": "for women."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:01.080",
    "end": "00:02:02.310",
    "start_seconds": 121.08,
    "end_seconds": 122.31,
    "text": "for women. Cuz you know, that's what people like,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:02.310",
    "end": "00:02:02.320",
    "start_seconds": 122.31,
    "end_seconds": 122.32,
    "text": "Cuz you know, that's what people like,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:02.320",
    "end": "00:02:05.470",
    "start_seconds": 122.32,
    "end_seconds": 125.47,
    "text": "Cuz you know, that's what people like, \"Ooh, I feel so bad for her.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:05.470",
    "end": "00:02:05.480",
    "start_seconds": 125.47,
    "end_seconds": 125.48,
    "text": "\"Ooh, I feel so bad for her.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:05.480",
    "end": "00:02:07.990",
    "start_seconds": 125.48,
    "end_seconds": 127.99,
    "text": "\"Ooh, I feel so bad for her.\" Stop feeling bad for women because"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:07.990",
    "end": "00:02:08.000",
    "start_seconds": 127.99,
    "end_seconds": 128.0,
    "text": "Stop feeling bad for women because"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:08.000",
    "end": "00:02:17.310",
    "start_seconds": 128.0,
    "end_seconds": 137.31,
    "text": "Stop feeling bad for women because Erica was having the time of her life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:17.320",
    "end": "00:02:20.390",
    "start_seconds": 137.32,
    "end_seconds": 140.39,
    "text": "The time of her life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:20.390",
    "end": "00:02:20.400",
    "start_seconds": 140.39,
    "end_seconds": 140.4,
    "text": "The time of her life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:20.400",
    "end": "00:02:21.630",
    "start_seconds": 140.4,
    "end_seconds": 141.63,
    "text": "The time of her life. Right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.630",
    "end": "00:02:21.640",
    "start_seconds": 141.63,
    "end_seconds": 141.64,
    "text": "Right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.640",
    "end": "00:02:23.510",
    "start_seconds": 141.64,
    "end_seconds": 143.51,
    "text": "Right? So I just pop up over there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:23.510",
    "end": "00:02:23.520",
    "start_seconds": 143.51,
    "end_seconds": 143.52,
    "text": "So I just pop up over there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:23.520",
    "end": "00:02:25.990",
    "start_seconds": 143.52,
    "end_seconds": 145.99,
    "text": "So I just pop up over there. She answered the door. She was"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:25.990",
    "end": "00:02:26.000",
    "start_seconds": 145.99,
    "end_seconds": 146.0,
    "text": "She answered the door. She was"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:26.000",
    "end": "00:02:27.430",
    "start_seconds": 146.0,
    "end_seconds": 147.43,
    "text": "She answered the door. She was I said, \"Look here."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:27.430",
    "end": "00:02:27.440",
    "start_seconds": 147.43,
    "end_seconds": 147.44,
    "text": "I said, \"Look here."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:27.440",
    "end": "00:02:28.430",
    "start_seconds": 147.44,
    "end_seconds": 148.43,
    "text": "I said, \"Look here. Uh"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:28.430",
    "end": "00:02:28.440",
    "start_seconds": 148.43,
    "end_seconds": 148.44,
    "text": "Uh"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:28.440",
    "end": "00:02:30.870",
    "start_seconds": 148.44,
    "end_seconds": 150.87,
    "text": "Uh we got to get back together.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:30.870",
    "end": "00:02:30.880",
    "start_seconds": 150.87,
    "end_seconds": 150.88,
    "text": "we got to get back together.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:30.880",
    "end": "00:02:34.070",
    "start_seconds": 150.88,
    "end_seconds": 154.07,
    "text": "we got to get back together.\" She was like, \"Why?\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:34.080",
    "end": "00:02:35.070",
    "start_seconds": 154.07999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 155.07,
    "text": "I said, \"We got to get back together"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:35.070",
    "end": "00:02:35.080",
    "start_seconds": 155.07,
    "end_seconds": 155.07999999999998,
    "text": "I said, \"We got to get back together"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:35.080",
    "end": "00:02:37.550",
    "start_seconds": 155.07999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 157.55,
    "text": "I said, \"We got to get back together because God has spoken."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:37.550",
    "end": "00:02:37.560",
    "start_seconds": 157.55,
    "end_seconds": 157.56,
    "text": "because God has spoken."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:37.560",
    "end": "00:02:39.990",
    "start_seconds": 157.56,
    "end_seconds": 159.99,
    "text": "because God has spoken. Let the church"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.990",
    "end": "00:02:40.000",
    "start_seconds": 159.99,
    "end_seconds": 160.0,
    "text": "Let the church"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:40.000",
    "end": "00:02:43.310",
    "start_seconds": 160.0,
    "end_seconds": 163.31,
    "text": "Let the church Amen.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:43.320",
    "end": "00:02:45.950",
    "start_seconds": 163.32,
    "end_seconds": 165.95,
    "text": "We get back together"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:45.950",
    "end": "00:02:45.960",
    "start_seconds": 165.95,
    "end_seconds": 165.96,
    "text": "We get back together"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:45.960",
    "end": "00:02:50.550",
    "start_seconds": 165.96,
    "end_seconds": 170.55,
    "text": "We get back together and it's worse."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:50.560",
    "end": "00:02:52.790",
    "start_seconds": 170.56,
    "end_seconds": 172.79,
    "text": "We get back together. We reconcile,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:52.790",
    "end": "00:02:52.800",
    "start_seconds": 172.79,
    "end_seconds": 172.8,
    "text": "We get back together. We reconcile,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:52.800",
    "end": "00:02:54.590",
    "start_seconds": 172.8,
    "end_seconds": 174.59,
    "text": "We get back together. We reconcile, reunited."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:54.590",
    "end": "00:02:54.600",
    "start_seconds": 174.59,
    "end_seconds": 174.6,
    "text": "reunited."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:54.600",
    "end": "00:02:59.110",
    "start_seconds": 174.6,
    "end_seconds": 179.11,
    "text": "reunited. And it don't feel good."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:59.120",
    "end": "00:03:01.590",
    "start_seconds": 179.12,
    "end_seconds": 181.59,
    "text": "Second time around"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:01.590",
    "end": "00:03:01.600",
    "start_seconds": 181.59,
    "end_seconds": 181.6,
    "text": "Second time around"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:01.600",
    "end": "00:03:04.750",
    "start_seconds": 181.6,
    "end_seconds": 184.75,
    "text": "Second time around and it's worse."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.750",
    "end": "00:03:04.760",
    "start_seconds": 184.75,
    "end_seconds": 184.76,
    "text": "and it's worse."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.760",
    "end": "00:03:05.910",
    "start_seconds": 184.76,
    "end_seconds": 185.91,
    "text": "and it's worse. I've been in church all my life. I know"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:05.910",
    "end": "00:03:05.920",
    "start_seconds": 185.91,
    "end_seconds": 185.92,
    "text": "I've been in church all my life. I know"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:05.920",
    "end": "00:03:09.070",
    "start_seconds": 185.92,
    "end_seconds": 189.07,
    "text": "I've been in church all my life. I know the song."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.080",
    "end": "00:03:19.550",
    "start_seconds": 189.08,
    "end_seconds": 199.55,
    "text": "Jesus he is this this"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:19.560",
    "end": "00:03:23.390",
    "start_seconds": 199.56,
    "end_seconds": 203.39,
    "text": "This pass after a while."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:23.400",
    "end": "00:03:25.390",
    "start_seconds": 203.4,
    "end_seconds": 205.39,
    "text": "Why would he put us back together if he"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.390",
    "end": "00:03:25.400",
    "start_seconds": 205.39,
    "end_seconds": 205.4,
    "text": "Why would he put us back together if he"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.400",
    "end": "00:03:28.150",
    "start_seconds": 205.4,
    "end_seconds": 208.15,
    "text": "Why would he put us back together if he wasn't going to fix it?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:28.150",
    "end": "00:03:28.160",
    "start_seconds": 208.15,
    "end_seconds": 208.16,
    "text": "wasn't going to fix it?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:28.160",
    "end": "00:03:29.750",
    "start_seconds": 208.16,
    "end_seconds": 209.75,
    "text": "wasn't going to fix it? And that's when I stumbled up. I was"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.750",
    "end": "00:03:29.760",
    "start_seconds": 209.75,
    "end_seconds": 209.76,
    "text": "And that's when I stumbled up. I was"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.760",
    "end": "00:03:31.470",
    "start_seconds": 209.76,
    "end_seconds": 211.47,
    "text": "And that's when I stumbled up. I was reading the Bible,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:31.470",
    "end": "00:03:31.480",
    "start_seconds": 211.47,
    "end_seconds": 211.48,
    "text": "reading the Bible,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:31.480",
    "end": "00:03:33.830",
    "start_seconds": 211.48,
    "end_seconds": 213.82999999999998,
    "text": "reading the Bible, your Bible."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.830",
    "end": "00:03:33.840",
    "start_seconds": 213.82999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 213.84,
    "text": "your Bible."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.840",
    "end": "00:03:35.590",
    "start_seconds": 213.84,
    "end_seconds": 215.59,
    "text": "your Bible. I was in Genesis. That's the first book"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.590",
    "end": "00:03:35.600",
    "start_seconds": 215.59,
    "end_seconds": 215.6,
    "text": "I was in Genesis. That's the first book"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.600",
    "end": "00:03:39.070",
    "start_seconds": 215.6,
    "end_seconds": 219.07,
    "text": "I was in Genesis. That's the first book in case you never opened it. And uh"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.070",
    "end": "00:03:39.080",
    "start_seconds": 219.07,
    "end_seconds": 219.07999999999998,
    "text": "in case you never opened it. And uh"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.080",
    "end": "00:03:41.750",
    "start_seconds": 219.07999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 221.75,
    "text": "in case you never opened it. And uh I was reading about how God had formed"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.750",
    "end": "00:03:41.760",
    "start_seconds": 221.75,
    "end_seconds": 221.76,
    "text": "I was reading about how God had formed"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.760",
    "end": "00:03:44.270",
    "start_seconds": 221.76,
    "end_seconds": 224.27,
    "text": "I was reading about how God had formed the world. I'm reading it and as I'm"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.270",
    "end": "00:03:44.280",
    "start_seconds": 224.27,
    "end_seconds": 224.28,
    "text": "the world. I'm reading it and as I'm"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.280",
    "end": "00:03:46.430",
    "start_seconds": 224.28,
    "end_seconds": 226.43,
    "text": "the world. I'm reading it and as I'm reading it I'm I'm noticing when God was"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.430",
    "end": "00:03:46.440",
    "start_seconds": 226.43,
    "end_seconds": 226.44,
    "text": "reading it I'm I'm noticing when God was"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.440",
    "end": "00:03:48.430",
    "start_seconds": 226.44,
    "end_seconds": 228.43,
    "text": "reading it I'm I'm noticing when God was forming the world, he was just speaking"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.430",
    "end": "00:03:48.440",
    "start_seconds": 228.43,
    "end_seconds": 228.44,
    "text": "forming the world, he was just speaking"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.440",
    "end": "00:03:50.350",
    "start_seconds": 228.44,
    "end_seconds": 230.35,
    "text": "forming the world, he was just speaking stuff. He was just saying, \"Hey, let"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.350",
    "end": "00:03:50.360",
    "start_seconds": 230.35,
    "end_seconds": 230.36,
    "text": "stuff. He was just saying, \"Hey, let"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.360",
    "end": "00:03:51.910",
    "start_seconds": 230.36,
    "end_seconds": 231.91,
    "text": "stuff. He was just saying, \"Hey, let there be this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:51.910",
    "end": "00:03:51.920",
    "start_seconds": 231.91,
    "end_seconds": 231.92000000000002,
    "text": "there be this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:51.920",
    "end": "00:03:53.390",
    "start_seconds": 231.92000000000002,
    "end_seconds": 233.39,
    "text": "there be this. Let there be that.\" And stuff was just"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.390",
    "end": "00:03:53.400",
    "start_seconds": 233.39,
    "end_seconds": 233.4,
    "text": "Let there be that.\" And stuff was just"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.400",
    "end": "00:03:54.710",
    "start_seconds": 233.4,
    "end_seconds": 234.71,
    "text": "Let there be that.\" And stuff was just forming."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.710",
    "end": "00:03:54.720",
    "start_seconds": 234.71,
    "end_seconds": 234.72,
    "text": "forming."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.720",
    "end": "00:03:56.590",
    "start_seconds": 234.72,
    "end_seconds": 236.59,
    "text": "forming. And then he said, \"Man, I need a player"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:56.590",
    "end": "00:03:56.600",
    "start_seconds": 236.59,
    "end_seconds": 236.6,
    "text": "And then he said, \"Man, I need a player"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:56.600",
    "end": "00:03:58.230",
    "start_seconds": 236.6,
    "end_seconds": 238.23,
    "text": "And then he said, \"Man, I need a player for real"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:58.230",
    "end": "00:03:58.240",
    "start_seconds": 238.23,
    "end_seconds": 238.24,
    "text": "for real"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:58.240",
    "end": "00:03:59.950",
    "start_seconds": 238.24,
    "end_seconds": 239.95,
    "text": "for real on the earth.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:59.950",
    "end": "00:03:59.960",
    "start_seconds": 239.95,
    "end_seconds": 239.96,
    "text": "on the earth.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:59.960",
    "end": "00:04:01.750",
    "start_seconds": 239.96,
    "end_seconds": 241.75,
    "text": "on the earth.\" So he got some dirt,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:01.750",
    "end": "00:04:01.760",
    "start_seconds": 241.75,
    "end_seconds": 241.76,
    "text": "So he got some dirt,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:01.760",
    "end": "00:04:05.350",
    "start_seconds": 241.76,
    "end_seconds": 245.35,
    "text": "So he got some dirt, spit in it, shake it up, shake it up."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:05.350",
    "end": "00:04:05.360",
    "start_seconds": 245.35,
    "end_seconds": 245.36,
    "text": "spit in it, shake it up, shake it up."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:05.360",
    "end": "00:04:06.950",
    "start_seconds": 245.36,
    "end_seconds": 246.95,
    "text": "spit in it, shake it up, shake it up. Threw it out there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.950",
    "end": "00:04:06.960",
    "start_seconds": 246.95,
    "end_seconds": 246.96,
    "text": "Threw it out there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.960",
    "end": "00:04:09.270",
    "start_seconds": 246.96,
    "end_seconds": 249.27,
    "text": "Threw it out there. There go Adam."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.270",
    "end": "00:04:09.280",
    "start_seconds": 249.27,
    "end_seconds": 249.28,
    "text": "There go Adam."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.280",
    "end": "00:04:10.950",
    "start_seconds": 249.28,
    "end_seconds": 250.95,
    "text": "There go Adam. He gives Adam a job, give him"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.950",
    "end": "00:04:10.960",
    "start_seconds": 250.95,
    "end_seconds": 250.96,
    "text": "He gives Adam a job, give him"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.960",
    "end": "00:04:12.310",
    "start_seconds": 250.96,
    "end_seconds": 252.31,
    "text": "He gives Adam a job, give him assignment. He tell him, \"Look here,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.310",
    "end": "00:04:12.320",
    "start_seconds": 252.31,
    "end_seconds": 252.32,
    "text": "assignment. He tell him, \"Look here,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.320",
    "end": "00:04:14.590",
    "start_seconds": 252.32,
    "end_seconds": 254.59,
    "text": "assignment. He tell him, \"Look here, man. I need you to make sure everything"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:14.590",
    "end": "00:04:14.600",
    "start_seconds": 254.59,
    "end_seconds": 254.6,
    "text": "man. I need you to make sure everything"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:14.600",
    "end": "00:04:16.550",
    "start_seconds": 254.6,
    "end_seconds": 256.55,
    "text": "man. I need you to make sure everything straight. I need you to have dominion. I"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:16.550",
    "end": "00:04:16.560",
    "start_seconds": 256.55,
    "end_seconds": 256.56,
    "text": "straight. I need you to have dominion. I"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:16.560",
    "end": "00:04:19.030",
    "start_seconds": 256.56,
    "end_seconds": 259.03,
    "text": "straight. I need you to have dominion. I need you to name all the animals, do all"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:19.030",
    "end": "00:04:19.040",
    "start_seconds": 259.03,
    "end_seconds": 259.04,
    "text": "need you to name all the animals, do all"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:19.040",
    "end": "00:04:21.630",
    "start_seconds": 259.04,
    "end_seconds": 261.63,
    "text": "need you to name all the animals, do all that.\" And Adam did it. And when that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.630",
    "end": "00:04:21.640",
    "start_seconds": 261.63,
    "end_seconds": 261.64,
    "text": "that.\" And Adam did it. And when that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.640",
    "end": "00:04:24.270",
    "start_seconds": 261.64,
    "end_seconds": 264.27,
    "text": "that.\" And Adam did it. And when that was over, Adam start looking at these"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.270",
    "end": "00:04:24.280",
    "start_seconds": 264.27,
    "end_seconds": 264.28,
    "text": "was over, Adam start looking at these"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.280",
    "end": "00:04:26.510",
    "start_seconds": 264.28,
    "end_seconds": 266.51,
    "text": "was over, Adam start looking at these animals going,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:26.510",
    "end": "00:04:26.520",
    "start_seconds": 266.51,
    "end_seconds": 266.52,
    "text": "animals going,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:26.520",
    "end": "00:04:29.990",
    "start_seconds": 266.52,
    "end_seconds": 269.99,
    "text": "animals going, \"Why are these ducks"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:29.990",
    "end": "00:04:30.000",
    "start_seconds": 269.99,
    "end_seconds": 270.0,
    "text": "\"Why are these ducks"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:30.000",
    "end": "00:04:32.310",
    "start_seconds": 270.0,
    "end_seconds": 272.31,
    "text": "\"Why are these ducks stuck"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:32.310",
    "end": "00:04:32.320",
    "start_seconds": 272.31,
    "end_seconds": 272.32,
    "text": "stuck"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:32.320",
    "end": "00:04:40.550",
    "start_seconds": 272.32,
    "end_seconds": 280.55,
    "text": "stuck together?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:40.560",
    "end": "00:04:43.190",
    "start_seconds": 280.56,
    "end_seconds": 283.19,
    "text": "I don't know what they doing,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:43.190",
    "end": "00:04:43.200",
    "start_seconds": 283.19,
    "end_seconds": 283.2,
    "text": "I don't know what they doing,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:43.200",
    "end": "00:04:46.070",
    "start_seconds": 283.2,
    "end_seconds": 286.07,
    "text": "I don't know what they doing, but boy, it looks fun."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:46.070",
    "end": "00:04:46.080",
    "start_seconds": 286.07,
    "end_seconds": 286.08,
    "text": "but boy, it looks fun."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:46.080",
    "end": "00:04:51.430",
    "start_seconds": 286.08,
    "end_seconds": 291.43,
    "text": "but boy, it looks fun. Why are these zebras behind each other?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:51.440",
    "end": "00:04:53.670",
    "start_seconds": 291.44,
    "end_seconds": 293.67,
    "text": "I don't know what they doing,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:53.670",
    "end": "00:04:53.680",
    "start_seconds": 293.67,
    "end_seconds": 293.68,
    "text": "I don't know what they doing,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:53.680",
    "end": "00:04:55.910",
    "start_seconds": 293.68,
    "end_seconds": 295.90999999999997,
    "text": "I don't know what they doing, but it looks fun."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:55.910",
    "end": "00:04:55.920",
    "start_seconds": 295.90999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 295.92,
    "text": "but it looks fun."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:55.920",
    "end": "00:04:58.150",
    "start_seconds": 295.92,
    "end_seconds": 298.15,
    "text": "but it looks fun. Why are these giraffes on top of one"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:58.150",
    "end": "00:04:58.160",
    "start_seconds": 298.15,
    "end_seconds": 298.15999999999997,
    "text": "Why are these giraffes on top of one"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:58.160",
    "end": "00:04:59.830",
    "start_seconds": 298.15999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 299.83,
    "text": "Why are these giraffes on top of one another?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:59.830",
    "end": "00:04:59.840",
    "start_seconds": 299.83,
    "end_seconds": 299.84000000000003,
    "text": "another?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:59.840",
    "end": "00:05:04.070",
    "start_seconds": 299.84000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 304.07,
    "text": "another? God noticed Adam's curiosity."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:04.070",
    "end": "00:05:04.080",
    "start_seconds": 304.07,
    "end_seconds": 304.08,
    "text": "God noticed Adam's curiosity."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:04.080",
    "end": "00:05:06.190",
    "start_seconds": 304.08,
    "end_seconds": 306.19,
    "text": "God noticed Adam's curiosity. So God looked down and said, \"Ooh, this"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:06.190",
    "end": "00:05:06.200",
    "start_seconds": 306.19,
    "end_seconds": 306.2,
    "text": "So God looked down and said, \"Ooh, this"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:06.200",
    "end": "00:05:11.070",
    "start_seconds": 306.2,
    "end_seconds": 311.07,
    "text": "So God looked down and said, \"Ooh, this boy needs somebody to play with.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:11.080",
    "end": "00:05:14.750",
    "start_seconds": 311.08,
    "end_seconds": 314.75,
    "text": "Okay, I forgot y'all church folk."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:14.750",
    "end": "00:05:14.760",
    "start_seconds": 314.75,
    "end_seconds": 314.76,
    "text": "Okay, I forgot y'all church folk."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:14.760",
    "end": "00:05:16.430",
    "start_seconds": 314.76,
    "end_seconds": 316.43,
    "text": "Okay, I forgot y'all church folk. So y'all Bible probably say God looked"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:16.430",
    "end": "00:05:16.440",
    "start_seconds": 316.43,
    "end_seconds": 316.44,
    "text": "So y'all Bible probably say God looked"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:16.440",
    "end": "00:05:19.590",
    "start_seconds": 316.44,
    "end_seconds": 319.59,
    "text": "So y'all Bible probably say God looked down and said, \"It's not good for man to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:19.590",
    "end": "00:05:19.600",
    "start_seconds": 319.59,
    "end_seconds": 319.6,
    "text": "down and said, \"It's not good for man to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:19.600",
    "end": "00:05:22.670",
    "start_seconds": 319.6,
    "end_seconds": 322.67,
    "text": "down and said, \"It's not good for man to be alone.\" Is that what y'all Bible say?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:22.670",
    "end": "00:05:22.680",
    "start_seconds": 322.67,
    "end_seconds": 322.68,
    "text": "be alone.\" Is that what y'all Bible say?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:22.680",
    "end": "00:05:25.110",
    "start_seconds": 322.68,
    "end_seconds": 325.11,
    "text": "be alone.\" Is that what y'all Bible say? Same thing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:25.110",
    "end": "00:05:25.120",
    "start_seconds": 325.11,
    "end_seconds": 325.12,
    "text": "Same thing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:25.120",
    "end": "00:05:26.990",
    "start_seconds": 325.12,
    "end_seconds": 326.99,
    "text": "Same thing. Grow up. There's a lot of versions now"
